# Rendered audio is many gigabytes and is regenerated from seeds, never
# committed. What belongs in git is the code that renders it.
#
# These patterns are anchored: an unanchored "corpus/" also matches the source
# package RoleSpecialist/corpus and silently drops it from the repository.
/data/
/renders/
/checkpoints/
/runs/
*.wav
*.flac
*.pt
*.ckpt

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# CodeGraph keeps a local index per checkout and must never be shared.
.codegraph/
